sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServeGW as KServe Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KServeProxy as KServe Proxy<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy)
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP gRPC/HTTP2
    participant DP as DataPlane<br/>(Middleware → Cache → Batcher)
    participant Model as Model Runtime<br/>(in-process or worker)
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8082/TCP
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker<br/>9092/TCP

    Note over Client,Model: Flow 1: REST Inference Request
    Client->>KServeGW: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: Platform auth (Bearer/mTLS)
    KServeGW->>KServeProxy: Forward (TLS terminated)
    KServeProxy->>REST: HTTP/8080 (plaintext)<br/>No auth (handled upstream)
    REST->>DP: InferenceRequest
    DP->>DP: Middleware → Cache lookup → Adaptive batching
    DP->>Model: dispatch to runtime
    Model-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>REST: Response + cache insert
    REST-->>KServeProxy: HTTP 200 JSON
    KServeProxy-->>KServeGW: Forward
    KServeGW-->>Client: HTTPS JSON Response

    Note over Client,Model: Flow 2: gRPC Inference Request
    Client->>KServeGW: ModelInfer RPC<br/>Auth: Platform auth
    KServeGW->>KServeProxy: Forward (TLS terminated)
    KServeProxy->>GRPC: gRPC/8081 (plaintext)
    GRPC->>DP: InferenceRequest
    DP->>Model: dispatch to runtime
    Model-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>GRPC: Response
    GRPC-->>KServeProxy: gRPC Response
    KServeProxy-->>KServeGW: Forward
    KServeGW-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Kafka,Model: Flow 3: Kafka Inference (Optional)
    Kafka->>Kafka: Producer sends to<br/>mlserver-input topic
    Note right of Kafka: MLServer consumes
    Kafka-->>DP: CloudEvent → InferenceRequest
    DP->>Model: dispatch to runtime
    Model-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>Kafka: Produce to<br/>mlserver-output topic

    Note over REST,OTel: Observability
    REST->>OTel: OTLP trace spans (gRPC)
    GRPC->>OTel: OTLP trace spans (gRPC)
    Prom->>Prom: GET /metrics<br/>Prometheus scrapes 8082/TCP
